      <uml:ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="note074" body="AI khong tu cham. Chi khi khai thi cho phep cham AI thi job moi duoc xep hang. Giao thuc noi bo Backend - AI: POST /ai/evaluate/session voi header X-Internal-Token (= AI_SERVICE_SECRET_KEY), base URL http://ai-service:8000, timeout 300s. Hangfire queue: luu job trong schema hangfire cua PostgreSQL; server aives-grading-* chay 1 worker  tren queue grading (aives-api-* xu ly queue default / answers); retry 30s -&gt; 120s -&gt; 300s, toi da 3 lan (BR-17)." />
